<title>FINLAND: ASPO PLANS FIM 147 MLN FINNYARDS SHIP BUY.</title>
<headline>ASPO PLANS FIM 147 MLN FINNYARDS SHIP BUY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals and electronics group and steel wholesaler Aspoyhtyma Oy said on Thursday it had agreed to buy a 13,000 DWT cargo ship from Finnyards, for delivery in autumn 1998.</p>
<p>&quot;The price of the order, including shipyard subsidy, is about 147 million markka and the degree of domestic input is about 80 percent,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The ship was ordered by Aspo's ESL Shipping Oy unit and is intended for transport of bulk goods on the Baltic Sea, Aspo said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0247, news@reuters.fi</p>
